ymbols` as the current 25-symbol legacy active subset from `legacy_config.py SYMBOLS` through the V2 Symbol Universe service; this subset is not the full universe. Expose `dynamic_discovered_symbols` as the broader passive discovery universe from Binance Futures, CoinAnk, CoinAPI, KuCoin, and future ingestors. Expose selected `training_symbols` and `paper_symbols` as subsets chosen by evidence, not as all discovered symbols. Expose `live_symbols` as an empty list while live remains `blocked_human_only`, and keep `live_blocked_symbols` explicit. Workers must not train or trade all discovered symbols automatically. Candidate scoring must cite liquidity, volume, volatility, funding, open interest, spread, freshness, feature completeness, exchange availability, risk profile, model confidence, replay performance, and operator overrides. CoinAnk-only symbols remain market-intelligence candidates until Binance USD-M tradability is confirmed.",
claude_worklog/agent_supervisor/tasks/093_codex_recovery_2e1d_end_file_marker_leakage_cleanup.json:29:  "prompt": "You are Codex acting as autonomous recovery agent under REQ_0015 (Planner-Level Human Attention Codex Autorecovery). Trigger condition: the prior planner turn emitted six files with a trailing standalone 'END_FILE: <path>' marker line that the materializer failed to strip; two of the six files are JSON task definitions that the supervisor cannot parse, blocking dispatch of milestone 2E1.D.\n\nYou do NOT modify /home/wali/Desktop/AI BOT. You do NOT modify any v2/ source or test file. You do NOT modify any prior-milestone trainer-parity source or test file under v2/backend/app/services/trainer_parity/, v2/backend/app/domain/trainer_liveness*, v2/backend/app/domain/liveness_stream_growth, v2/backend/app/domain/trainer_liveness_observation_collector, v2/backend/app/domain/trainer_liveness_composition, or v2/backend/app/adapters/redis_v2/. You do NOT write or read Redis. You do NOT restart any live service. You do NOT place, modify, or cancel any exchange order. You do NOT change leverage or margin. You do NOT enable live trading. You do NOT deploy. You do NOT run any production migration. You do NOT expose or commit secrets.\n\nScope of allowed edits in this task:\n- claude_worklog/agent_supervisor/tasks/091_trainer_parity_2e1d_service_composition_implementation.json (strip trailing END_FILE: <path> line only)\n- claude_worklog/agent_supervisor/tasks/092_trainer_parity_2e1d_service_composition_codex_review.json (strip trailing END_FILE: <path> line only)\n- claude_worklog/phase2_core_rebuild/trainer_gpu_parity_impl/112_PHASE_2E1D_SERVICE_COMPOSITION_SPEC.md (strip trailing END_FILE: <path> line only)\n- claude_worklog/phase2_core_rebuild/trainer_gpu_parity_impl/113_PHASE_2E1D_SERVICE_COMPOSITION_TEST_PLAN.md (strip trailing END_FILE: <path> line only)\n- claude_worklog/phase2_core_rebuild/trainer_gpu_parity_impl/114_PHASE_2E1D_SERVICE_COMPOSITION_SAFETY_BOU